      {
        "block_id": "SmZNdbrjHoLjq9xzLZHcj8ddn1f",
        "block_type": 2,
        "parent_id": "PFevdrzDhoKAP3x7PY8cXTwCnJe",
        "text": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "Zilliz Cloud is likewise available on the ",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "AWS Marketplace",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "link": {
                    "url": "https%3A%2F%2Faws.amazon.com%2Fmarketplace%2Fpp%2Fprodview-iqbidum7feuio"
                  },
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": true
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": ", making it easier than ever to access our fully managed vector database services on AWS. This integration couldn’t come at a better time as demand for AI applications grows. With Zilliz Cloud on AWS Marketplace, users can quickly build and scale their AI applications.",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "align": 1,
            "folded": false
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "block_id": "EpakdSOWdoFyixx32J5cP1WVnad",
        "block_type": 2,
        "parent_id": "PFevdrzDhoKAP3x7PY8cXTwCnJe",
        "text": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "One of the benefits of this integration is the ability to manage products seamlessly. Billing, cancellations, refunds, and more can all be governed and tracked on your user’s AWS account. This feature alone saves you time and hassle, streamlining the entire process.",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "align": 1,
            "folded": false
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "block_id": "Jk8EdCfohoKH4OxYGt8cvD7annc",
        "block_type": 2,
        "parent_id": "PFevdrzDhoKAP3x7PY8cXTwCnJe",
        "text": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "Another advantage is the ability to view costs through AWS Cost Explorer. This tool lets you easily track expenses and gain insight into billing and cost management processes.",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "align": 1,
            "folded": false
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "block_id": "KHaRdQuT6ojgFixNkD1cpiLUnwb",
        "block_type": 2,
        "parent_id": "PFevdrzDhoKAP3x7PY8cXTwCnJe",
        "text": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "For details, refer to ",
