      {
        "block_id": "IHS5dX48RoiA4zxlMzxc9QeGn3b",
        "block_type": 12,
        "bullet": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "Rolling Upgrade",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "align": 1,
            "folded": false
          }
        },
        "children": [
          "YUqid71mSojTOixn6CzcBmfhnlY",
          "IjyGdyTLMoZGiIxkjuucsPbJnob"
        ],
        "parent_id": "TAEedr1hho6UpjxGHhBcn9nFnbf"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "YUqid71mSojTOixn6CzcBmfhnlY",
        "block_type": 2,
        "parent_id": "IHS5dX48RoiA4zxlMzxc9QeGn3b",
        "text": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "Milvus users have had to perform various maintenance tasks periodically to ensure system health. However, maintenance work on a production system can be risky. Typically, maintenance work is performed during scheduled downtime, which requires taking the database offline and suspending normal business operations. Unfortunately, today’s users are intolerant of prolonged periods of downtime.",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "align": 1,
            "folded": false
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "block_id": "IjyGdyTLMoZGiIxkjuucsPbJnob",
        "block_type": 2,
        "parent_id": "IHS5dX48RoiA4zxlMzxc9QeGn3b",
        "text": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "The good news is that Zilliz Cloud now supports rolling upgrades. With your vector databases deployed on Zilliz Cloud, you no longer need to worry about scheduled maintenance. Instead, set up a maintenance window and focus on your business while we handle the rest. In most cases, service downtime due to the rolling upgrade will be less than 1 minute per month.",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "align": 1,
            "folded": false
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "block_id": "A5BWddcnCoIsEVx3v8ac4CHFn5e",
        "block_type": 12,
        "bullet": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "Backup and Restore",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "align": 1,
            "folded": false
          }
        },
        "children": [
          "B55Kd2PbYoSS4fxygpKc7wQ4nvI",
          "TVgBd8T32oAvQAxh1cacAgzon1e",
          "FYZtdfycdo4CWixx4O0c2Xiknzf"
        ],
        "parent_id": "TAEedr1hho6UpjxGHhBcn9nFnbf"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "B55Kd2PbYoSS4fxygpKc7wQ4nvI",
        "block_type": 2,
        "parent_id": "A5BWddcnCoIsEVx3v8ac4CHFn5e",
        "text": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "The Backup and Restore feature is now available with Zilliz Cloud. Data loss can happen to anyone at any time. The consequences can be devastating, whether due to a hardware failure, a software glitch, or even human error. That’s why it’s critical to have a reliable backup and recovery solution for databases in place.",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "align": 1,
            "folded": false
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "block_id": "TVgBd8T32oAvQAxh1cacAgzon1e",
        "block_type": 2,
        "parent_id": "A5BWddcnCoIsEVx3v8ac4CHFn5e",
        "text": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "With the new backup and restore feature, you can now easily back up your database and restore it in case of an unexpected loss.",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "align": 1,
            "folded": false
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "block_id": "FYZtdfycdo4CWixx4O0c2Xiknzf",
        "block_type": 2,
        "parent_id": "A5BWddcnCoIsEVx3v8ac4CHFn5e",
        "text": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "For details, refer to ",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
